\item We use real patient data from Montefiore hospitals to compute a tree policy and obtain novel triage guidelines for ventilator allocations for COVID-19 patients. We compare our guidelines with the official NYS guidelines and show that our guidelines are able to reduce the number of excess deaths associated with ventilator shortages.
